{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based party platformer in the disco. Your goal: get to the dance floor \u2013 faster than everyone else. Shortcuts, risky jumps, clean timing. 1\u20134 players locally (supports Remote Play Together). Editor &amp; Community Levels provide a constant stream of new courses with online leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/c296c7696573337b2e279dd6f4c5203f.avif?t=1771261672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras_big/c296c7696573337b2e279dd6f4c5203f.webp?t=1771261672 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/cb7c3f3f8779ea1a3441d67f8470a58b.poster.avif?t=1771261672\" width=1138 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/cb7c3f3f8779ea1a3441d67f8470a58b.webm?t=1771261672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally with up to <strong>4 friends</strong>. Help each other... or push each other out at the last second. The main thing is that the room is roaring. Now also via <strong>Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/dd5e4d678060aee181bceb6d231dc91e.poster.avif?t=1771261672\" width=1138 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/dd5e4d678060aee181bceb6d231dc91e.webm?t=1771261672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the intuitive <strong>editor</strong>, you can create your own disco courses in minutes and share them immediately. Browse through <strong>community levels</strong>. New <strong>challenges</strong> every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/5749bc26f3f233777238afc86d0de0c6.poster.avif?t=1771261672\" width=1138 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/5749bc26f3f233777238afc86d0de0c6.webm?t=1771261672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is a <strong>race</strong>. Use physics to your advantage. Discover <strong>shortcuts</strong>, hunt for the <strong>best online time</strong>, and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/dbeb526d2b1b5bdf12f49181a9d7f5c6.poster.avif?t=1771261672\" width=1138 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/dbeb526d2b1b5bdf12f49181a9d7f5c6.webm?t=1771261672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>chains of chaos</strong> with precise lasers, catapulting cannons, and bouncy disco balls. <strong>Combine</strong> the objects to create nasty timings or fun party traps. Perfect for trolling, tinkering, and celebrating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/bf3318b507f37251e56952f4126c636a.poster.avif?t=1771261672\" width=1138 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/bf3318b507f37251e56952f4126c636a.webm?t=1771261672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful scenery, glittering balls, and cute cube characters. The perfect setting for chaotic <strong>party platforming</strong> fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras/c296c7696573337b2e279dd6f4c5203f.avif?t=1771261672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/extras_big/c296c7696573337b2e279dd6f4c5203f.webp?t=1771261672 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Party platformer, goal: reach the dance floor</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1\u20134 players locally + Remote Play Together</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Editor &amp; Community Levels with continuous supply</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Online leaderboards &amp; shortcut-friendly tracks</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Physics-based movement: easy to learn, hard to master</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disco gadgets (lasers, cannons, disco balls, switches, pressure plates)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Campaign &amp; Single Player</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Full controller support (incl. Steam Deck)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Family-friendly</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Completely original soundtrack</i></p></li></